The LK150 Quick Start introduces you
to all the pieces and parts of your

00:28:07.630 --> 00:28:11.810
machine so that you know what they're
used for and what they're called.

00:28:11.840 --> 00:28:13.960
We go back to that whole Glossary again.

00:28:13.990 --> 00:28:18.380
I don't want you to be looking up,
what does she mean by a latch tool?

